WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.289 --> 00:00:04.396
Hey, it’s Thankful Thursday

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.179
and I believe that it’s important to thank the people

00:00:07.364 --> 00:00:09.619
and companies who have had an impact on your life

00:00:09.796 --> 00:00:12.815
on your business because you can’t do this all alone.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.933
You need help, you need people to lift you up

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:20.081
and support you and so I make these videos once a week

00:00:20.209 --> 00:00:22.439
to thank the people in my life who are having an impact

00:00:22.582 --> 00:00:25.002
and I hope you’ll reach out to your contacts

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:27.327
and thank them, just give them some recognition.

00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:30.285
So today I want to thank Sage Software.

00:00:30.687 --> 00:00:32.413
And Sage, they make accounting software

00:00:32.882 --> 00:00:33.834
and you may think

00:00:33.944 --> 00:00:35.937
‘Sage accounting software, why are you thanking them?’

00:00:36.272 --> 00:00:39.855
They used to be a client and I did some social media work with them

00:00:40.017 --> 00:00:41.841
and I haven’t talked to them for a while

00:00:42.051 --> 00:00:42.956
and I recently touched base

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:46.443
and I’ve been so impressed with what they’re doing in social media.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.027
Most companies, they blast out coupon codes

00:00:50.399 --> 00:00:53.819
and marketing and “We just launched our new product.

00:00:53.949 --> 00:00:54.933
Everybody come and buy it!”

00:00:55.202 --> 00:00:59.763
and as a result you get zero engagement because nobody cares about that stuff.

00:01:00.329 --> 00:01:02.054
That’s not what social media is all about.

00:01:02.348 --> 00:01:04.671
And Sage, these guys get it.

00:01:04.909 --> 00:01:07.043
You go to Sage’s page, they’re talking about;

00:01:07.575 --> 00:01:10.932
they recognize other customer who just got into whole foods

00:01:11.063 --> 00:01:12.420
and they’re tweeting pictures about them

00:01:12.627 --> 00:01:15.583
they’re recognizing people on their team who had a birthday

00:01:15.777 --> 00:01:19.302
and they’re showcasing what they did to their cubicle at the company

00:01:19.669 --> 00:01:22.557
they’re sharing inspirational quotes, they’re sharing articles

00:01:22.738 --> 00:01:24.122
they have nothing to do with accounting

00:01:24.414 --> 00:01:26.108
but will help entrepreneurs grow their businesses.

00:01:26.175 --> 00:01:27.998
They’re trying to be a resource.

00:01:28.726 --> 00:01:30.325
This is what’s important about social media.

00:01:30.453 --> 00:01:33.549
You’re not out there just broadcasting and selling.

00:01:34.278 --> 00:01:37.662
The point of social media is to build relationships with customers

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:43.610
and these guys – they actually care about their customers.

00:01:44.078 --> 00:01:48.222
Imagine that, a big company that actually cares about their customers.

00:01:48.663 --> 00:01:52.588
Now I’m fortunate to work with a number of different big brands

00:01:52.911 --> 00:01:56.462
who have that same mindset and same philosophy

00:01:56.803 --> 00:01:58.334
and I work with them on their campaigns.

00:01:58.822 --> 00:02:00.855
But most companies aren’t like that

00:02:01.022 --> 00:02:04.264
and it’s so refreshing to see a company like Sage stepping up

00:02:04.668 --> 00:02:07.200
and doing it and bucking a trend

00:02:07.426 --> 00:02:11.252
and I’m sure whoever is running their campaigns there are facing

00:02:11.622 --> 00:02:14.674
you know, internal criticism or external criticism to say

00:02:14.811 --> 00:02:16.174
“Hey, this is how you’re supposed to do it”

00:02:16.533 --> 00:02:19.851
but they’re getting results and building a strong community

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.020
and that’s what social media is all about.

00:02:22.345 --> 00:02:25.539
So thank you Sage for your leadership and inspiration

00:02:25.715 --> 00:02:28.363
and for helping the entrepreneur community.

00:02:28.571 --> 00:02:32.785
And for all of you watching, take 5 minutes today

00:02:32.916 --> 00:02:34.982
to thank somebody who’s had an impact on your business

00:02:35.184 --> 00:02:36.370
on your life somehow.

00:02:36.679 --> 00:02:39.859
Send an email, write a note, take somebody out to coffee

00:02:40.035 --> 00:02:42.956
make a video if you want to, it doesn’t have to be complex

00:02:43.282 --> 00:02:44.506
just say thank you.

00:02:44.683 --> 00:02:46.413
They’ll feel better, you’ll feel better

00:02:46.976 --> 00:02:48.236
and you brighten everybody’s day.

00:02:48.607 --> 00:02:49.369
Believe.

00:02:49.765 --> 00:02:51.336
You guys liked this video, thumbs-up below.

00:02:51.629 --> 00:02:54.646
If you want to support me, click on the support link in the description

00:02:54.953 --> 00:02:57.082
and leave a comment. I’d love to hear from you.

00:02:57.209 --> 00:02:59.064
Thank you so much, see you soon.

